# clang-tidy configuration, run on every C++ source of Ichor as it compiles when ICHOR_RUN_CLANG_TIDY
# is on (CMakeLists.txt), and read by clangd. A finding fails that compile. Written against
# clang-tidy 23; CMakeLists.txt refuses an older one.
#
# Every bugprone and modernize check, except:
# - modernize-use-trailing-return-type: a style, not a modernisation. It would rewrite every
#   function signature to `auto f() -> T`.
# - bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters: what it finds are pairs such as key and value, or user
#   and password, whose order is the API. Telling them apart takes a type per parameter, an API
#   break with no bug behind it.
#
# Options:
# - bugprone-exception-escape.CheckMain: an exception escaping main terminates the program, which
#   is all the examples and benchmarks would do with it.
# - bugprone-signed-bitwise.IgnorePositiveIntegerLiterals: shifting or masking by a positive literal
#   is well defined, `x << 8` needs no 8u.
# - modernize-avoid-c-arrays.AllowStringArrays: a char array of deduced size initialised from a
#   string literal is that literal, std::array would make its length something to keep in sync.
#
# A finding that is only wrong at one place gets a NOLINT comment with the reason next to it
# instead.
#
# Headers are checked when their path has an include/, src/, test/, examples/ or benchmarks/
# directory in it, unless they are the vendored code in those. That would match a third party
# library's include/ as well, but the libraries in external/ and the system's are included as
# system headers, which clang-tidy never checks. CMakeLists.txt marks the vendored sources
# SKIP_LINTING.
Checks: >-
  -*,
  bugprone-*,
  modernize-*,
  -modernize-use-trailing-return-type,
  -bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters
WarningsAsErrors: '*'
HeaderFilterRegex: '/(include|src|test|examples|benchmarks)/'
ExcludeHeaderFilterRegex: '/external/|/common/lyra\.hpp$|/gsm_enc/|/beast_benchmark/fields_alloc\.hpp$'
CheckOptions:
  bugprone-exception-escape.CheckMain: false
  bugprone-signed-bitwise.IgnorePositiveIntegerLiterals: true
  modernize-avoid-c-arrays.AllowStringArrays: true
